    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Qwen-Image 2.1 Turbo \u00b7 Image + Text \u2192 Image (multi-reference)\n- **image_1 is the edit target**; image_2\u2026 are references. Refer to them in the prompt as `<image1>`, `<image2>`, \u2026 (up to **10**).\n- image_1\u20132 are active. image_3\u20136 are **bypassed** (purple): select one and press **Ctrl+B** to enable it, then pick a file. For 7\u201310, duplicate a LoadImage and connect it to the next `images.image_N` slot on the Instruction node.\n- **resolution** on the Instruction node = total pixel budget each ref is resized to (1024 official, up to 2048; 0 = keep own size).\n- Output follows **image_1's** size. Flip the *Custom size* switch to use ResolutionSelector instead (keep it close to image_1's aspect or the edit can drift).\n- Model switch (yellow, left): false = `Turbo Q8_0 GGUF`, true = `Turbo FP8`.\n\n**Sampling (Turbo):** the checkpoint's own 8-step schedule in *Turbo schedule* (ManualSigmas), euler, cfg **1**. Changing the steps means editing that list; Qwen hasn't evaluated other schedules. The negative prompt is ignored at cfg 1."
   ],
